'''Kurask Lair''' is a dungeon beneath [[Laguna Aurorae]], accessed by a [[Cave entrance (Kurask Lair)|cave entrance]]. It is a small cave that contains eight [[kurask]]. A [[dwarf multicannon]] can be used in the dungeon, although cannonballs don't damage kurask. The entire dungeon is single-way combat.

{{Map|mtype=pin|1191,2786|align=left|icon=redPin|caption=The entrance to the lair.}}

==Trivia==
* Four of the kurask in the lair are large kurask, compared to the [[Fremennik Slayer Dungeon]] only having one large kurask.

